unkWave Universe.\n\nBuilt as a dedicated VR playback environment, FunkWave VR Player allows users to stream and experience curated first-party content, including original music, visualizers, and cinematic VR presentations created specifically for the FunkWave Universe platform. Content is presented in a controlled, immersive setting optimized for comfort, performance, and visual fidelity.\n\nThe application functions as a standalone VR media player and does not require user accounts, subscriptions, or third-party integrations. An active internet connection is required to stream content. No personal data is collected, tracked, or stored.\n\nFunkWave VR Player is intended as a premium experience for users seeking immersive VR media playback centered around original creative works and exclusive FunkWave Universe releases.", "short_description": "A premium VR media player for immersive FunkWave Universe experiences, featuring exclusive music, visuals, and cinematic content."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.h2dindustries.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "H2D Industries Entertainment, LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.h2dindustries.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25548224224787697"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "no